{"id": "10f815bb-f4d6-45b4-a041-c1dbdb9f2ed8", "slug": "quantum-sync-analytics", "title": "Quantum Sync Analytics", "description": "Quantum Sync UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Quantum Sync Analytics\"\ndescription: \"Quantum Sync UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#00F0FF\"\n  secondary: \"#F8FAFC\"\n  accent: \"#64748B\"\n  background: \"#64748B\"\n  surface: \"#E2E8F0\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Quantum Sync Analytics\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Samnang Aing (@samnang). Views: 5; favorites: 2; remixes: 1.\nTags: ui, css, dashboard, app, interface.\n## Overview\nQuantum Sync UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\n\nZone-A Zone-B SEQ: 01 // OVERVIEW Quantum Sync Mainframe / Interface Clusters Online 03 // LOG 02 // STATE N -W E -S 04 // COMMS 88 . 91 LINK: ENCRYPTED LATENCY: 4MS Phase Coherence WX-9 88 . 7 % Security Auto-Alignment…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Quantum Sync; Mainframe / Interface.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #00F0FF, secondary #F8FAFC, accent #64748B, background #64748B, surface #E2E8F0, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and JetBrains Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Quantum Sync Analytics</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@200;300&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@100;200;300&family=Outfit:wght@200;300&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#64748b] min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4 md:p-12 overflow-hidden selection:bg-[#00f0ff] selection:text-[#030712]\">\n\n    <!-- Main Container -->\n    <div id=\"main-card\" class=\"relative w-full max-w-[1400px] aspect-[4/3] md:aspect-[21/9] rounded-xl shadow-2xl overflow-hidden flex group\"\n         style=\"background-color: #030712;\n                background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, #030712 0px, #030712 16px, #080e1a 16px, #080e1a 32px);\n                box-shadow: 0 40px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.6), inset 0 2px 4px rgba(255,255,255,0.08), inset 0 -4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.9);\n                --mouse-x: 50%;\n                --mouse-y: 50%;\">\n\n        <!-- Schematic Grid Overlay -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0 opacity-40\"\n             style=\"background-size: 40px 40px; background-image: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(0,240,255,0.06) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,240,255,0.06) 1px, transparent 1px);\">\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Vertical Container-Size Lines -->\n        <div class=\"absolute left-[25%] top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-[#00f0ff]/20 z-10 hidden md:flex flex-col justify-end pb-8 items-center\">\n            <span class=\"text-[#00f0ff]/40 text-xs font-['JetBrains_Mono'] uppercase tracking-widest font-thin\" style=\"writing-mode: vertical-rl;\">Zone-A</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"absolute left-[50%] top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-[#00f0ff]/10 z-10 hidden md:block\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute left-[75%] top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-[#00f0ff]/20 z-10 hidden md:flex flex-col justify-start pt-8 items-center\">\n            <span class=\"text-[#00f0ff]/40 text-xs font-['JetBrains_Mono'] uppercase tracking-widest font-thin\" style=\"writing-mode: vertical-rl;\">Zone-B</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Horizontal Lines -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-[33%] left-0 right-0 h-px bg-[#00f0ff]/10 z-10 hidden md:block\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-[66%] left-0 right-0 h-px bg-[#00f0ff]/10 z-10 hidden md:block\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Deep Space Lighting Gradient -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0\"\n             style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, transparent 0%, rgba(3,7,18,0.8) 100%);\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Scanner Hover Effect -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none z-20 transition-opacity duration-700 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 border border-[#00f0ff]/50\"\n             style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(0,240,255,0.15) 0px, rgba(0,240,255,0.15) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 24px),\n                                      repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg, rgba(0,240,255,0.15) 0px, rgba(0,240,255,0.15) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 24px);\n                    mask-image: radial-gradient(400px circle at var(--mouse-x) var(--mouse-y), black 0%, transparent 100%);\n                    -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(400px circle at var(--mouse-x) var(--mouse-y), black 0%, transparent 100%);\">\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- High-Tech Corner Brackets -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-10 h-10 border-b border-r border-[#00f0ff]/50 z-30 flex items-start justify-start p-2\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#00f0ff] shadow-[0_0_8px_#00f0ff]\"></div></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-10 h-10 border-b border-l border-[#00f0ff]/50 z-30 flex items-start justify-end p-2\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#00f0ff] shadow-[0_0_8px_#00f0ff]\"></div></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-10 h-10 border-t border-r border-[#00f0ff]/50 z-30 flex items-end justify-start p-2\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#00f0ff] shadow-[0_0_8px_#00f0ff]\"></div></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-10 h-10 border-t border-l border-[#00f0ff]/50 z-30 flex items-end justify-end p-2\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#00f0ff] shadow-[0_0_8px_#00f0ff]\"></div></div>\n\n        <!-- Top Left Typography -->\n        <div class=\"absolute left-6 md:left-12 top-6 md:top-12 z-30 pointer-events-none flex flex-col gap-1\">\n            <div class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-[#00f0ff]/70 mb-2 font-thin tracking-widest\">SEQ: 01 // OVERVIEW</div>\n            <h1 class=\"font-['Outfit',sans-serif] text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extralight tracking-tight text-[#f8fafc] leading-none\">\n                Quantum Sync\n            </h1>\n            <h2 class=\"font-['Inter',sans-serif] text-xl md:text-2xl font-thin tracking-tight text-[#00f0ff] uppercase mt-1\">\n                Mainframe / Interface\n            </h2>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Bottom Left Typography -->\n        <div class=\"absolute left-6 md:left-12 bottom-6 md:bottom-12 z-30 pointer-events-none hidden md:flex flex-col items-center gap-6\">\n            <div class=\"font-['Inter',sans-serif] text-lg font-thin tracking-tight text-[#00f0ff] uppercase opacity-90\" style=\"writing-mode: vertical-rl; transform: rotate(180deg);\">\n                Clusters Online\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-[#00f0ff]/70 font-thin tracking-widest\" style=\"writing-mode: vertical-rl; transform: rotate(180deg);\">03 // LOG</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Top Right Typography -->\n        <div class=\"absolute right-6 md:right-12 top-6 md:top-12 z-30 pointer-events-none flex items-start gap-6 hidden md:flex\">\n            <div class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs tracking-widest text-[#00f0ff]/70 uppercase font-thin mt-1\">\n                02 // STATE\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 text-center text-[#e2e8f0] font-thin text-xs tracking-widest font-['Inter',sans-serif]\">\n                <div class=\"col-start-2 text-[#00f0ff]\">N</div>\n                <div class=\"col-start-1 row-start-2\">-W</div>\n                <div class=\"col-start-2 row-start-2 flex items-center justify-center text-[#00f0ff]\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-linear\" class=\"text-base\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-start-3 row-start-2\">E</div>\n                <div class=\"col-start-2 row-start-3\">-S</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Bottom Right Typography -->\n        <div class=\"absolute right-6 md:right-12 bottom-6 md:bottom-12 z-30 pointer-events-none text-right flex flex-col items-end gap-3\">\n            <div class=\"font-['Outfit',sans-serif] text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extralight tracking-tight text-[#f8fafc] leading-none flex items-start gap-4\">\n                <span class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-[#00f0ff]/70 font-thin tracking-widest mt-1\">04 // COMMS</span>\n                <div>88<span class=\"text-[#00f0ff]\">.</span>91</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-[#e2e8f0] opacity-80 uppercase tracking-widest space-y-1 font-thin mt-1\">\n                <p>LINK: ENCRYPTED</p>\n                <p>LATENCY: 4MS</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Dashboard Grid Overlay -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-30 flex items-center justify-center p-6 md:p-24 pointer-events-none\">\n            <div class=\"w-full max-w-3xl grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 md:gap-6 pointer-events-auto mt-24 md:mt-8\">\n\n                <!-- Panel 1: Phase Coherence -->\n                <div class=\"border border-[#00f0ff]/30 bg-[#0f172a]/70 backdrop-blur-md p-6 flex flex-col gap-5 hover:border-[#00f0ff]/70 hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,240,255,0.1)] transition-all group/panel rounded-sm\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n                        <span class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-[#00f0ff]/90 tracking-widest uppercase\">Phase Coherence</span>\n                        <!-- Custom Dropdown -->\n                        <div class=\"border border-[#00f0ff]/40 bg-[#030712] px-3 py-1.5 flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer hover:border-[#00f0ff] hover:bg-[#00f0ff]/10 transition-colors rounded-sm\">\n                            <span class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-[#f8fafc] font-thin tracking-widest\">WX-9</span>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-down-linear\" class=\"text-[#00f0ff] text-xs\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <div class=\"font-['Outfit',sans-serif] text-4xl md:text-5xl tracking-tight text-[#f8fafc] font-extralight\">\n                            88<span class=\"text-[#00f0ff]\">.</span>7<span class=\"text-lg text-[#00f0ff]/70\">%</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"w-full h-px bg-[#00f0ff]/30 mt-5 relative\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 h-full bg-[#00f0ff] w-[88.7%] shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(0,240,255,0.8)]\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Panel 2: Controls & Sliders -->\n                <div class=\"border border-[#00f0ff]/30 bg-[#0f172a]/70 backdrop-blur-md p-6 flex flex-col justify-between gap-5 hover:border-[#00f0ff]/70 hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,240,255,0.1)] transition-all rounded-sm\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2\">\n                        <span class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-[#00f0ff]/90 tracking-widest uppercase\">Security</span>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:lock-password-linear\" class=\"text-[#00f0ff] text-lg\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- Custom Toggle -->\n                    <label class=\"flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer group/toggle\">\n                        <span class=\"font-['Inter',sans-serif] text-sm text-[#e2e8f0] font-thin tracking-tight\">Auto-Alignment</span>\n                        <div class=\"w-10 h-5 border border-[#00f0ff]/50 rounded-full relative bg-[#00f0ff]/10 transition-colors group-hover/toggle:border-[#00f0ff]\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute left-1 top-1 w-3 h-3 bg-[#00f0ff] rounded-full transition-transform translate-x-5 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(0,240,255,0.9)]\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </label>\n                    <!-- Custom Slider -->\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 mt-2\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-[#e2e8f0] font-thin tracking-widest\">\n                            <span>AMPLITUDE</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-[#00f0ff]\">64%</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"w-full h-1.5 bg-[#00f0ff]/20 relative cursor-pointer group/slider rounded-full\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 h-full bg-[#00f0ff] w-[64%] rounded-full shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(0,240,255,0.6)]\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-[64%] -translate-y-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-3 h-5 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-sm shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(0,240,255,1)] group-hover/slider:scale-110 transition-transform\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Panel 3: Active Clusters -->\n                <div class=\"border border-[#00f0ff]/30 bg-[#0f172a]/70 backdrop-blur-md p-6 flex flex-col gap-4 hover:border-[#00f0ff]/70 hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,240,255,0.1)] transition-all rounded-sm\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2\">\n                        <span class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-[#00f0ff]/90 tracking-widest uppercase\">Linked Clusters</span>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:database-linear\" class=\"text-[#00f0ff] text-lg\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- Custom Checkbox 1 -->\n                    <label class=\"flex items-center gap-4 cursor-pointer group/cb\">\n                        <div class=\"w-4 h-4 border border-[#00f0ff] bg-[#00f0ff]/20 flex items-center justify-center relative rounded-sm\">\n                            <div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-[#00f0ff] shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(0,240,255,0.9)] rounded-sm\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-[#f8fafc] font-thin tracking-widest\">CLUSTER-X1</span>\n                    </label>\n                    <!-- Custom Checkbox 2 -->\n                    <label class=\"flex items-center gap-4 cursor-pointer group/cb\">\n                        <div class=\"w-4 h-4 border border-[#00f0ff]/50 flex items-center justify-center relative group-hover/cb:border-[#00f0ff] transition-colors rounded-sm\">\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-[#e2e8f0]/60 font-thin tracking-widest\">CLUSTER-X2</span>\n                    </label>\n                    <!-- Custom Checkbox 3 -->\n                    <label class=\"flex items-center gap-4 cursor-pointer group/cb\">\n                        <div class=\"w-4 h-4 border border-[#00f0ff] bg-[#00f0ff]/20 flex items-center justify-center relative rounded-sm\">\n                            <div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-[#00f0ff] shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(0,240,255,0.9)] rounded-sm\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-[#f8fafc] font-thin tracking-widest\">CLUSTER-X3</span>\n                    </label>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Panel 4: Log Output -->\n                <div class=\"border border-[#00f0ff]/30 bg-[#0f172a]/70 backdrop-blur-md p-6 flex flex-col gap-3 justify-between hover:border-[#00f0ff]/70 hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,240,255,0.1)] transition-all rounded-sm\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n                        <span class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-[#00f0ff]/90 tracking-widest uppercase\">Log Output</span>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:document-text-linear\" class=\"text-[#00f0ff] text-lg\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-[#e2e8f0]/80 font-thin tracking-widest space-y-3 mt-2\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-[#00f0ff]/10 pb-1\"><span>> BOOT_SEQ...</span> <span class=\"text-[#00f0ff]\">PASS</span></div>\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-[#00f0ff]/10 pb-1\"><span>> TICK_RATE:</span> <span class=\"text-[#00f0ff]\">240HZ</span></div>\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-[#00f0ff]/10 pb-1\"><span>> DATA_DROP:</span> <span class=\"text-[#00f0ff]\">0.00%</span></div>\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between opacity-60 pt-1\"><span>> STANDBY_MODE_</span> <span class=\"animate-pulse text-[#00f0ff]\">_</span></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Interactive Scanner Script -->\n    <script>\n        const card = document.getElementById('main-card');\n        card.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n            const rect = card.getBoundingClientRect();\n            const x = e.clientX - rect.left;\n            const y = e.clientY - rect.top;\n            card.style.setProperty('--mouse-x', `${x}px`);\n            card.style.setProperty('--mouse-y', `${y}px`);\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "quantum-sync-analytics.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/quantum-sync-analytics.jpg", "source_name": "quantum-sync-analytics-DESIGN.md", "views": 127, "forks": 6, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "66a84ecf-0972-40f3-8a4c-15b11d3aee0a", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T20:54:35.568511+00:00"}